WEBVTT

00:12:59.935 --> 00:13:02.295
where they'll spend hundreds
of dollars a night

00:13:02.295 --> 00:13:05.453
in order to hand over
their cell phone and their laptop

00:13:05.453 --> 00:13:07.657
to the front desk on arrival.

00:13:07.657 --> 00:13:10.622
Some people I know,
just before they go to sleep,

00:13:10.622 --> 00:13:12.746
instead of scrolling through
their messages

00:13:12.746 --> 00:13:14.418
or checking out YouTube,

00:13:14.418 --> 00:13:17.662
just turn out the lights
and listen to some music,

00:13:17.662 --> 00:13:20.088
and notice that they sleep much better

00:13:20.088 --> 00:13:23.301
and wake up much refreshed.

00:13:23.301 --> 00:13:25.507
I was once fortunate enough

00:13:25.507 --> 00:13:30.547
to drive into the high, dark mountains
behind Los Angeles,